 "name_en": "Scheduling Agreements in Procurement (BMR)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Scheduling Agreements in Procurement (BMR)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio363af8b3e9c6422abafae8eac09e6177\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio363af8b3e9c6422abafae8eac09e6177__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The use of scheduling agreements can shorten processing times and reduce the amount of paperwork you are faced with. One delivery schedule can replace many discrete purchase orders or contract release orders.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Delivery of the total quantity of materials specified in a scheduling agreement item is spread over a certain period in a delivery schedule, consisting of lines indicating the individual quantities with their corresponding planned delivery dates.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Inventories can be reduced to a minimum. You can perform your manufacturing operations on the Just-in-Time (JIT) principle.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">Your suppliers require shorter lead times. Smaller deliveries are required, which can be spaced out over a longer period. Delivery scheduling enables suppliers to plan and allocate their resources more efficiently.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio363af8b3e9c6422abafae8eac09e6177__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create or change scheduling agreement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain delivery schedule</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain quota arrangement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release scheduling agreement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods receipt</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create supplier invoice</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio363af8b3e9c6422abafae8eac09e6177__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Use scheduling agreements to reduce processing times and the amount of paperwork within your enterprise</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use scheduling agreements to replace many standard purchase orders or contract release orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Generate fewer manual FI postings. Periodic invoicing generates and releases the supplier invoices</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>采购中的计划协议 (BMR)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio363af8b3e9c6422abafae8eac09e6177\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio363af8b3e9c6422abafae8eac09e6177__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">使用计划协议可以缩短处理时间，并减少您面临的文书工作量。一个交货计划可以替换许多离散采购订单或合同审批订单。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">计划协议项目中指定的物料总数量交货分布在交货计划的特定期间内，包括指示各个数量及其相应计划交货日期的行。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">可将库存减少到最小。您可以在准时制生产 (JIT) 原则上执行制造操作。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">您的供应商需要更短的提前期。需要较小的交货，可以在更长时间内进行间距。交货计划使供应商能够更有效地计划和分配资源。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio363af8b3e9c6422abafae8eac09e6177__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建或更改计划协议</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">维护交货计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">维护配额协议</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">发布计划协议</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建供应商发票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio363af8b3e9c6422abafae8eac09e6177__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用计划协议缩短处理时间，减少企业内的文书工作量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用计划协议替换许多标准采购订单或合同执行订单。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">生成较少的手动 FI 过账。定期开发票会生成并下达供应商发票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
